description=Local web hotspot management for rooted Android (KernelSU). Hotspot control, traffic quota, client management, scheduling, SMS forward, mihomo proxy, PushPlus/DingTalk/Bark/ServerChan notifications. Primarily tested on Xiaomi 14 / HyperOS 3 / Android 16. v1.7.4-beta: MAC whitelist, new-device notification, daily scheduled restart, data exhaustion forecast, login fail lockout, device adaptation check; v1.7.3-beta: hidden SSID.
